    (W syntax) There is a possible problem with the mixing of a control
    flow operator (e.g. return) and a low-precedence operator like
    or.  Consider:
    
        sub { return $a or $b; }
    
    This is parsed as:
    
        sub { (return $a) or $b; }
    
    Which is effectively just:
    
        sub { return $a; }
    
